data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":103,"item_id":"rs_01735d5b69007772016ac94680d6888194a0c3aa96ce42807a","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Automating tests**\n\nI’m looking to automate the testing subprocess lifecycle and manage temporary files outside of the repository. I need to ensure that I can use my own artifacts effectively. I can't run the server on ports assigned to the node test file. So, I need to select a random free port via net, then spawn an environment, perhaps assigning a range like 190xx for retries and timeouts. I'll run tests and restart as needed, noting that the browser isn't available, but I should mention the API."}}

